# 🌍 StudyBuddy Global

StudyBuddy Global is a student-to-student learning platform that connects learners across the world.

## 🚀 Features

- 🌎 Connect with students worldwide
- 💬 Real-time chat
- 📚 Ask and answer academic questions
- 🤖 AI-powered study assistance
- 🌐 Language translation
- 🏆 XP, badges, and leaderboards
- 📷 Image sharing
- 🎤 Voice messages
- 🔒 Secure authentication

## 🛠 Tech Stack

Frontend:
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

Backend:
- Flask
- PostgreSQL
- SQLAlchemy
- Socket.IO

## 📌 Status

This project is under active development.

